 "TSH normal, lithium level therapeutic, renal function normal.",
 "What is the most appropriate next pharmacological principle?",
 "Avoid an unopposed antidepressant; consider a mood-stabiliser adjustment, lamotrigine, quetiapine, lurasidone, or specialist-guided options",
 ["High-dose fluoxetine alone, stopping lithium","A TCA as safest in bipolar depression","Stop all medication immediately","St John's wort as first-line"],
